{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46 2期生 丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YDTR51A2N7E4TBRNHG8A0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n青いフリフリ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月1日からCoCo壱さん、糖質オフメニューが発売されるようです！\nなんと、ご飯の代わりにカリフラワーを使用！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりしました！！糖質を控えている方にぴったりですね！私も嬉しいです😆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新メニュー、とっても楽しみ！早く食べたいな〜🤤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばきんちゃんが、CoCo壱さんにはカレードリアとかカレーうどんもあるよ！美味しいよ〜！と教えてくれました！\n私はまだ食べれていないので食べたいな〜😋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに前に食べたいよ〜って言っていた包みカレーナン🍛食べることができました！美味しかったです😁👍🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YDVS55RXF3N3GWV88MSXE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YDWX97JB73TES5EX3B35G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋が一緒で色々話せて嬉しかった〜！😆✌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YDXYPDD3E0G584A94R5XK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このフィルター可愛いんよ〜って言いました！ふわふわしてて可愛いですよね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YDYZP7JV2SNQRNQ2DNK94","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このちゃん〜！\nそうそうそう！！このちゃんで思い出した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YE0078WY4YBT9SZ6E0QX7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の携帯でひながこのちゃんを撮ったんだけど、なんか面白くて！この距離感がなんか不思議でツボでした😂😂😂\nしかもカメラ目線〜！笑 絶対載せるー！って思いました 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YE12H57DCFAMPEKFXPDYZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YE21THQ89ZJD5WQNJN969","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィルターで遊んでました〜！色々あって面白い😄2枚目、なんだかまなもらしいなって思った 爆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YE33J13ZKZ2SK7SP16208","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n寝てる美穂！笑かわいい🥰"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1YE44YJ2W3SB0NBWX3NZVM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは私はわざと目を瞑りました 笑\nわざと感が否めない〜 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美穂は本当に寝てます😴"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでいただきありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#109"}],"source":"archive"}